    <briefdescription>
<para>Metadata for a single plugin entry returned by the registry. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The registry returns entries in JSON format, e.g.: <programlisting filename=".json"><codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>&quot;name&quot;:<sp/>&quot;themis_analytics&quot;,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>&quot;version&quot;:<sp/>&quot;1.2.0&quot;,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>&quot;description&quot;:<sp/>&quot;Analytics<sp/>extension<sp/>for<sp/>ThemisDB&quot;,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>&quot;download_url&quot;:<sp/>&quot;https://registry.example.com/plugins/themis_analytics-1.2.0.so&quot;,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>&quot;sha256&quot;:<sp/>&quot;e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855&quot;,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>&quot;min_themis_version&quot;:<sp/>&quot;1.0.0&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
